{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898680/extras/44542ef182902fcdabea70d1157f7fa4.avif?t=1764198040\" width=296 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WZRDS is a Horde Survival Roguelite where you play as a wizard with powerful spells and abilities. Mix and match weapons and set bonuses, choose between dozens of items, create unique and powerful builds, and survive against waves of powerful spirits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898680/extras/e87d02fbd3dcd0c00950aa4c03464e65.webp?t=1764198040\" width=300 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over a dozen different weapons to choose from</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon scales from multiple elemental stats, allowing them to fill different roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of each weapon makes you experiment with different weapon combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix, Match, and optimize Set Bonuses to unlock your weapon's full potential\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has a powerful level 3 skill to unlock and experiment with</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898680/extras/195a1033dfc81da9ef8be8fe66413e80.webp?t=1764198040\" width=300 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Different WZRDS to choose from, each with their own</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Active abilities</strong>: Powerful spells with long cooldowns that can change how you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Passives</strong>: Constant modifiers that change the efficacy of the different weapons and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item sets</strong>: Each wzrd has a different item pool</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlocks</strong> : Multiple unlocks per character keep you coming back for more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898680/extras/e79337055d7d01e462c7c3be9712f860.webp?t=1764198040\" width=300 height=30 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30-40 minute runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of enemies over 20 waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Powerful Bosses to take down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ladder-Ascension difficulty system to climb</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Flaming Hot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3898680/9201664b09ed6597f1f96ca76583fcc4a3814de5.jpg"},{"name":"Ice Cold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3898680/78789d7f428caed30c91cf5d567bacc793d60321.jpg"},{"name":"Rock On","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3898680/c325b3ae751dcb44e6c70a8725c720d3cad02606.jpg"},{"name":"Liquid Tight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3898680/5e4a4d3deefb2c5ba8c3da3a032a68353bd7b682.jpg"},{"name":"Overgrown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3898680/149613e8ce55d8eebe9ec84a812020e34b4ddbb3.jpg"},{"name":"Blown Away","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3898680/dd993fe7a695de0a8d4f8cae3e1897d1e1acf872.jpg"},{"name":"Ascended","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3898680/7bbc3dc41e48f794041c72d197147d9391f4633d.jpg"},{"name":"Dark Side","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.